Z||000000||Sevaan||07-05-2001||12:27 AM||||Know what I like best about owning a Fiero? Apart from driving it?<P>I love maintaining it. It makes me feel all nice inside when I clean the interior, and modify the exterior. I like working on the car. Not fixing problems. Rather improving the whole vehicle.<P>Know what I hate the most about owning a Fiero? When the stupid thing breaks down! Like tonight. Argh. I have to take the bus to work tomorrow.<P>This has been a pseudo love/rant post, brought to you by the letter 'S'.<BR>The End.||||reg||1
